# Clementine Design Studio

> I'm Mali King, a web designer in Monterey, California. I design and build websites for small businesses, mostly on Squarespace, and also on Shopify and WordPress. I'm a Squarespace Circle Platinum Partner, I've built more than 350 websites over 7+ years, and I have a 5.0 rating from 115 client reviews. I work on my own, so clients work directly with me, and I work with businesses everywhere.

My Squarespace Marketplace and 99designs profiles use the name "Clementine Studio". Besides websites, I help with SEO, Google Ads, Facebook and Instagram ads, LinkedIn posts, email newsletters, monthly website maintenance and automations. I also built OptionKit, a Squarespace plugin for product options that change the price (sold through JuiceKit, getjuicekit.com).

## Services and prices

All prices are in US dollars. After a free 20-minute consultation, I send a quote with exact prices. Nothing starts until the client approves it.

- [Website-in-a-Day]({{ site.url }}/website-in-a-day): $1,500. A 1 to 5 page Squarespace website, built in one day.
- [Custom Website]({{ site.url }}/services/): from $3,000. 5+ pages on Squarespace, Shopify or WordPress, live in about 3 to 4 weeks.
- [Hourly help]({{ site.url }}/services/): $150 an hour for updates, layout changes and troubleshooting on an existing website.
- [Monthly maintenance]({{ site.url }}/monthly-plans): about $300 a month for ongoing changes and fixes.
- Logo and branding: $750 to $3,000.
- SEO: $1,200 to $3,000 to set up, then from $400 a month.
- Google Ads: from $750 to set up, then from $500 a month to manage, plus the ad budget paid to Google.
- Facebook and Instagram ads: from $750 to set up, then from $500 a month to manage, plus the ad budget paid to Facebook and Instagram.
- LinkedIn posts: $500 to set up, then from $500 a month.
- Email follow-ups and newsletters: from $300 a month.

